hanging research ideas. There is a lot of cross-country collaboration, both within Europe and more globally.”\\nDr Sue Pavord, President of the British Society for Hematology\\nOxford University Hospitals NIS FT, United Kingdom\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-82ed4576ec5ac8372f114a9b\", \"title\": \"EHA2027 Congress - The European Hematology Association (EHA)EHA2027 Congress - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3882, \"end\": 5254, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 1372}, {\"start\": 5495, \"end\": 5515, \"excerpt_start\": 1373, \"excerpt_end\": 1393}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"EHA2027 Congress\\nShape the future of hematology\\nJune 10–13, 2027\\n| Barcelona, Spain\\nLet’s meet at EHA2027, where we connect the global hematology community.\\nEHA2027 will once again offer an exceptional scientific program, featuring a seamless flow of engagement across plenary sessions—including the opening ceremony, plenary abstracts session, and presidential sessions—alongside carefully curated sponsored sessions spread throughout each Congress day.\\nWith a comprehensive program and two poster sessions, we look forward to sharing the latest clinical and research updates in hematology with you.\\nEHA2027 is intended for medical professionals, national hematology societies, patient advocates, medical industry, and media worldwide.\\nThe Congress is not open to the general public.\\nPatient advocates are welcome to attend scientific sessions.\\nKey Dates\\nMarch 1, 2027\\nAbstract submission deadline\\nGrant application deadline\\nMay 3, 2027\\nEarly registration deadline\\nMay 6, 2027\\nLate-breaking abstract submission deadline\\nJune 10-13, 2027\\nEHA2027 Congress in Barcelona, Spain\\nLatest information on EHA2027\\nEHA2027 registration\\nEHA2027 program\\nEHA2027 abstract submission\\nEHA2027 travel grants & abstract awards\\nEHA2027 sponsorship opportunities\\nEHA2027 details and deadlines\\nEHA2027 s